    "title": "Apexel APL-T18XBZJ5 Phone Photography Kit-Flexible Phone Tripod +Remote Shutter +4 in 1 Lens Kit-High Power 18X Monocular Telephoto Lens, Fisheye, Macro & Wide Angle Lens for iPhone X 8 7 6 Plus Samsung Smartphone",
    "body_html": "<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wWMEYkz3Zl4\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n<p><strong data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i0.122a56d5XGFxQM\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/APEXEL.jpg?v=1634008635\" data-mce-selected=\"1\" alt=\"Apexel apl-t18xbzj5 phone photography kit-flexible phone tripod +remote shutter +4 in 1 lens kit-high power 18x monocular telephoto lens,\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i0.122a56d5XGFxQM\"><img alt=\"Apexel apl-t18xbzj5 phone photography kit-flexible phone tripod +remote shutter +4 in 1 lens kit-high power 18x monocular telephoto lens,\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/IMG_0691_1.jpg?v=1636021288\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/IMG_0692_1.jpg?v=1636021304\" alt=\"Apexel apl-t18xbzj5 phone photography kit-flexible phone tripod +remote shutter +4 in 1 lens kit-high power 18x monocular telephoto lens,\" loading=\"lazy\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i0.122a56d5XGFxQM\">Features:</strong><br><span><strong>4 in 1 Cellphone Lens Universal Kit</strong></span>: Including 18X mobile phone telephoto lens + 198\u00b0 fish-eye lens + 0.63X wide angle lens + 15X macro lens, also equipped with 2pcs lens clips, a remote shutter, a mini tripod, a phone holder, a cleaning cloth, a waterproof cloth pouch.<br>Lenses are mainly manufactured with high quality glass optics.<br><span><strong>18X Telephoto Lens:</strong></span><span>\u00a0</span>Lightweight and handy size, the telephoto lens gets you 18X as close to the objects, workable with your phone whatever video or photo modes. Also work as a monocular with the cover, very great for concerts, matches, bird-watching or observing at long distance, etc.<br><span><strong>0.63X Wide Angle Lens:</strong></span><span>\u00a0</span>The wide angle lens can shoot larger range of scenery, very suitable for long cityscape and large group shots.<br><span><strong>15X Macro Lens</strong></span>: The macro lens can take clear photos of small objects, with 15X magnification. Usually use it for capturing flowers, insects, raindrop and other tiny things.<br><span><strong>198\u00b0 Fish-eye Lens:</strong></span><span>\u00a0</span>The fish-eye lens gives your images a round, fish bowl effect while also acts as a wide angle lens. Highlight the center things, great for capturing pets, party, skateboarder, etc.<br>The included mini flexible tripod, phone holder and phone holder are great accessories for mobile photography.<br><br><strong>Specifications:</strong><br>Brand: APEXEL<br>Model: APL-T18XBZJ5<br>Material: Glass Optics+ABS Plastic<br>Mounting Type: Clip<br>Compatible With: 98% of mobile phone<br>Color: Black<br><span><strong>--18X Telephoto Lens</strong></span><br>Magnification: 18X<br>View of Field: Approx. 1000m/3280ft<br>Size: 5 * 1.5 * 1.5 inch<br><span><strong>--190\u00b0 Fish-eye Lens</strong></span><br>Field View of Angle: 198 degree<br>Lens Construction: 3 elements in 3 groups<br>Max Diameter: 25mm<br><span><strong>--0.63X Wide Angle Lens</strong></span><br>Magnification: 0.63X<br>Lens Construction: 2 elements in 2 groups<br>Max Diameter: 20mm<br><span><strong>--15X Macro Lens</strong></span><br>Magnification: 15X<br>Lens Construction: 1 element in 1 group<br>Max Diameter: 20mm<br>Package Size: 17.8 * 11.4 * 4.3cm / 7 * 4.4 * 1.7in<br>Package Weight: 304g / 10.7oz<br><br><strong>Package List:</strong><br>1 * 18X Telephoto Lens<br>1 * Rear Cap<br>1 * 0.63X Wide+15X Macro Detachable Lens<br>1 * 198\u00b0 Fish-eye Lens<br>1 * Plastic Thread Clip<br>1 * Metal Thread Clip<br>1 * Eyecup<br>1 * Mini Tripod<br>1 * Phone Holder<br>1 * Remote Shutter<br>1 * Cleaning Cloth<br>1 * Waterproof Cloth Pouch<br>1 * User Manual (English)<br><br><strong>Note:</strong><br><span><strong>You need unscrew the wide angle part to get the macro lens. Wide angle lens can't be used alone. Macro lens can be used alone.</strong></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1ed4GIXXXXXadXVXXq6xXFXXXT/224531527/HTB1ed4GIXXXXXadXVXXq6xXFXXXT.jpg\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB14rgXNFXXXXXvXVXXq6xXFXXXx/229528066/HTB14rgXNFXXXXXvXVXXq6xXFXXXx.jpg\" width=\"710\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/v0t1p8FC6Mh496HckQH5nIVSB81w7g83sB3e9GgvxVa7hNtD645hVFdsTLBdR8pIgKRSookQeGFqSXp9qHA8UBImreCDzwH6pYV4_eU90PbenZiV1aMCoVvBSOBFBp0R7J-8e2GTh90lFreqwOVG9SQasqM9pvjhQGKzv-3XzsS71hU_sWWNVVmvGYzWNEKkg028Ilr5RNiRgUwWeXTo_X1hyzwx0Xl7A4ESF15jVRT3ThAJTVWtBL9D7LvnObW0l5snUCV1kr9ChKz4Q60X8PPbYEu6rqO0sB3waWwjYNq0nca4eTv9fPYpUy-zbkbzb-N2rcQB2-jVXgH813rFYfnWTVRdPdC2aF7QIlZaX6YYg2GNIbltCKU03lYnoF45kWx8qyRLm4NSLR04TJvuRtepiQNt244_XgPZIyim8JQV5JVOcWWbMdyuGI3-ybNA3I7Gg2eiU8Gdg-pYxcsQbLj_x-faWQLlBXu5ZdBpUKc3GfEyJZKOpdQ8JOIn9gFdFBGAsUC605pGFdAPXtq4T8cYZEFTCernmPVXXNUMYmiAbUZzvnBi_s22a0R-GUScGFF5IAviU_20HuoLGvh15NtP6QvBtbT6G4krxCbKx1sTE38IxnDipj05FVjyBRSIiigTc7tM_2zCK_oe8ccUdN_BZBZGDm6-7LQdlTqP1E2RMLTc_XoExwJIu0hSAtcMKiBaqVTvgvSXruKWAlmoSvVM=s929-no?authuser=1\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/YODd_EunyOY4Tq4ygp7SPeeAn6j7LyW8B7M5a1R4s0rlO3Va2fiK7S7_8BStKwR0hMAiSXA2PH6Bpr2qz_L8z8TSjuB12bqiFoZxnGSecSIVJ-Qda13i7kex79r0Nwvsh0X0NndmkF6SgQDqH9nEmp1gn4xzSISsIJNogKbvof0I7l71PfHtBSzN2kAIu9JjPBBClpjyvsk-Fg75yKM4DEzPP75CJsfUgAWgekah2qJWQT5S8v8YU_Y6gO60EmCIOTgAqCvrjuiRf2yavrgxjUMiQLKn2WUArz2epMcPUIjWDZQhNdEsoCGgNxMtXL6PV6ImjCnZkd51Sc9z7B0gfGvzsPpFkXfb-83wtB_yVwelvWtEw5VtC4ybjGjD4ytlA4cBGEwKCnIFWLGhgmqeR5EZ2M9WxPWiaNCtf8X0-szGPuqFF_ru_i1QSL1L_9ykt2v6mDIC9L2nVT7pA8QYF8baPOOgsXGH9mOCGFFpWvRqAbMBEbAtN5Icc0rZRqmzXmdrb5kVV24Q5dX2VYM_ikvLB-RW0Iob1GyaqK79_8HneuPs_iENivCLrNH-I9Txx8smZz-NBBrBLE-QblrhzBu0Ccd220kEMpZHBu99ChGUScP